{
 "esm": "1.0.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "duo_wind_geom",
  "description": "Shared geometric expression templates for the duo staggered-wind rules (Mouallem et al. vector remap): Cartesian cross products (duo_cross_{x,y,z}), great-circle tangent vectors cross(cross(a,b),a) (duo_tangent_{x,y,z}), and derived normalized/quadratic assemblies outlined from the generated rules (exact-tree verified against the original inline forms)."
